== Dangers ==

*Militia Skeleton, make sure not to mix up with decaying.

*Marauder, make sure not to mix up with footpad.

*Since most higher lvl enemies are mixed in be aware of trains or social with other mobs

*Aside from basic enemies there are two specific dangers, the first is [[The Tangrin]] who is off the northern shore on a small island. The second is [[Targishin]], an aggressive undercon skeleton that stands guards over the entrance to [[Kaesora]].

== Benefits ==

*Scorpions & beetles provide a good source of money.

*Scaled wolf pups are hunted for their curscale skins to make the rare curskin armor.

*You can be bound on a platform near the entrance to [[Kaesora]], which is very convenient for anyone hunting in either Kurn's or Kaesora.

== Traveling To and From The Field Of Bone ==

*[[Cabilis|East Cabilis]] is located in the southwestern corner of the field, and since Iksars have their guilds in Cabilis, this provides easy access to the field.

*[[Warsliks Wood]] is located in the Northwest behind a hill range.

*[[Kurn's Tower]] is located Northeast of the pit standing tall above it.

*[[Kaesora]] is located in the large ruins to the East.

*[[Emerald Jungle]] is located behind the large ruins to the East.

*[[Swamp of No Hope]] is located directly below the pit in the South.

A [[Field of Bone Port]] will take you to -1961,340 near the Kaesora ruins

